  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be wiccecræftum. Ond we cwædon be þam wiccecræftum ⁊ be liblacum ⁊ be morðdædum, gif mon þær acweald wære, ⁊ he his ætsacan ne mihte, þæt he beo his feores scyldig.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And we have declared with regard to witchcraft and sorceries and deadly spells, if death is occasioned thereby, and [the accused] cannot deny it [the charge], that he shall forfeit his life.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Be wiccecræftum. And we cwedon be ðam wiccecræftum ⁊ be lyblacum ⁊ morðdædum, gyf ðær man acweald wære, ⁊ he his ætsacan [B ends; Liebermann continues with Ld] ne mæg, þæt he beo his feores scyldig.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
